WEBVTT

00:00:59.076 --> 00:01:00.756
The disrespect.

00:01:13.236 --> 00:01:14.676
(Marshallese) Iakwe nan aolep.

00:01:17.356 --> 00:01:18.836
My name is Selina Leem.

00:01:20.596 --> 00:01:23.316
At 18 at the COP 21,

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:27.156
alongside late ambassador
for climate change Tony de Brum,

00:01:27.156 --> 00:01:31.436
I introduced myself
as a small island girl with big dreams.